    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>L-IMGCDN rewrites WordPress image URLs to your CDN. Configure a CDN domain, include/exclude rules, and safe fallback to origin.</p>\n<h3>中文说明</h3>\n<p>本插件将图片 URL 重写到你的 CDN，支持自定义域名、路径规则与回源兜底。</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>l-imgcdn.zip</code> and activate.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> L-IMGCDN</strong> to configure.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='will%20it%20break%20non-image%20urls%3F'>\nWill it break non-image URLs?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. Only image MIME types are targeted, honoring your rules.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.5.0</h4>\n<p>Initial public release.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Rewrite image URLs to your CDN for faster delivery. Supports custom domains, path patterns, and safe fallback to origin.",
    "description": "<p>L-IMGCDN rewrites WordPress image URLs to your CDN. Configure a CDN domain, include/exclude rules, and safe fallback to origin.</p>\n<h3>中文说明</h3>\n<p>本插件将图片 URL 重写到你的 CDN，支持自定义域名、路径规则与回源兜底。</p>\n",
